      "value": "like once we get avatar dynamics the possibilities will be a lot more and something like this would fit with it really well. or like i add vrc lens but dont want it to be global anyway why should i be syncing it to you then. or a avatar password system or flight colliders. non of that need to be synced so why should it count towards your parameters.",
