  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-01T01:22:39.257Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "add additional local saved non synced parameters. what im thinking is all users to add more parameters than the normal 128 but if there defined as local like add an additional check box for if there synced or not if there not set as synced they don't count towards your 128 since there only saved and loaded locally. you could have like 1024 local parameters and the 128 synced so like theirs some limit so people don't go to overboard but still a lot of extra. this would be really nice for things like vrc lens and stuff were you may want it to be local and not take up 40+ parameter spots when no ones going to see it anyway. or you could have a Hud or more complex and precise expression menu stuff and use parameter drivers to manipulate some of the synced parameters so others can see it but giving you more controls and options to use it. like parameters are currently saved to a file on your pc so having extra local ones that you don't even sync to the network shouldn't be to much to add but give a lot to avatar makers that like adding more complex logic to there avatars. this will become even more useful once avatar dynamics comes out as. this will open up a whole new world for some people and its all local so theres not many real negatives to adding this.",
